|---|---|
| **Product** | ELI VR, an official ELI bundle: a spatial workspace for a headset or a monitor |
| **Product id on the Licence Key** | `vr` |
| **Price** | Set at checkout and shown on your receipt |
| **Licence** | Perpetual, one-time purchase (master terms §3) |
| **Version line covered** | ELI VR 1.x. Releases before 1.0 belong to the 1.x line |
| **Machines / seats** | As stated on your Licence Key and receipt |
| **Updates** | Every release in the version line (master terms §4) |
| **With ELI v3** | ELI's presence in the rooms, and opening ELI VR from ELI v3, also need an ELI v3 licence. ELI VR also runs on its own |
| **Support** | **[to confirm]** |

## 1. Grant

On purchase, you receive the licence in §3 of the master terms for ELI VR, for the version line and
number of machines or seats above. ELI VR is a separate ELI Product: an ELI v3 licence does not
include it, and its licence does not include ELI v3.

## 2. Health and safety

2.1 Virtual reality can cause motion sickness, eye strain, disorientation and loss of balance. Stop
using it if you feel unwell, and take regular breaks.

2.2 Some people can have seizures or blackouts triggered by light patterns. If you or anyone in your
family has a history of epilepsy or seizures, consult a doctor before using ELI VR.

2.3 Use ELI VR in a clear, safe space. While wearing a headset you cannot see your surroundings.

2.4 Follow your headset manufacturer's safety instructions and age guidance. Those instructions
apply in addition to this schedule.

## 3. Hardware and third-party runtimes

3.1 ELI VR runs through OpenXR runtimes and headset software made by third parties, such as
SteamVR, Monado and headset vendors' own software. Each is licensed by its maker under its own terms.

3.2 ELI VR's documentation lists the hardware it has been tested on. We do not promise that it works
with any particular headset, controller or runtime.

## 4. Privacy

ELI VR has no accounts and no telemetry, and sends nothing to us. Anything it shows of your desktop
or your rooms stays on your machine.

## 5. Changes to the master terms

None.

