# ELI v3 — Personal tier (supplement to COMMERCIAL_EULA.md)

**Tier:** Personal · **Seats:** 1 machine · **Updates:** every 3.x release · **Support:** email

## Grant

Non-exclusive license to install and run ELI v3 on **one (1) machine** for **personal,
non-commercial** use.

## You may

- Run ELI for yourself (home, hobby, learning)
- Modify the Software for your own use on the licensed machine
- Keep your data local under your control

## You may not

- Use in a business or for client work (upgrade to **Pro**)
- Install on more than one machine without an additional license
- Redistribute, publish, or resell the Software or your license key

