# ELI v3 — Pro tier (supplement to COMMERCIAL_EULA.md)

**Tier:** Pro · **Seats:** up to 3 machines · **Updates:** every 3.x release · **Support:** priority email

## Grant

Non-exclusive license to install and run ELI v3 on up to **three (3) machines** for
**commercial and professional** use by the licensee (individual or sole trader / small team
named on the order).

## You may

- Use ELI in your business, freelance work, and client-facing workflows on licensed machines
- Modify the Software for your own licensed deployment
- Bind one key across your allowed seats (deactivate old hardware before moving seats)

## You may not

- Exceed the seat count on your receipt
- Offer ELI as a hosted multi-tenant service to third parties
- Redistribute, publish, or resell the Software or keys

