# ELI v3 — Trial tier (supplement to COMMERCIAL_EULA.md)

**Tier:** Trial · **Seats:** 1 machine · **Term:** 7 days (unless stated on receipt)

You may evaluate a **paid build** of ELI v3 with full features for the trial period. This is not
a license to redistribute, resell, or use after expiry.

Each installation receives its own trial, identified by a unique trial reference
(`ELI-TRIAL-…`), granted once per machine and bound to that machine. A trial that has run its
term is revoked and cannot be restarted on the same machine.

At expiry you must purchase Personal, Pro, or Enterprise, or stop using the Software.
